WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.660
Independent.

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:01.960
Independent networks.

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.420
They're a little bit better, but I

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.780
would say that we're an example of how

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:08.580
you don't need to be part of a super large company

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:10.420
to be able to do just basic journalism.

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:12.300
All you've got to do is sit and record,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.660
and you'll let the story play out.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.140
And that's why they hate us.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.420
That's why Antifa targets us.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:19.100
A level of dishonesty that's incredible,

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.059
where answers are changed.

00:00:21.059 --> 00:00:22.860
Like just before the election, an answer

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.620
was changed by Kamala.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:29.740
She gave a horrible, death-defying, election-defying

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.119
answer, and they took the answer out

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:33.880
and they replaced it with another answer

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.860
that she gave five minutes later,

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.439
having to do with a different subject.

00:00:37.439 --> 00:00:40.200
But at least it wasn't election-defying.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.240
No, the level of dishonesty with the media

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:45.599
is incredible, whether it's on Antifa or many

00:00:45.599 --> 00:00:46.560
of the other groups.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.000
You're talking about Antifa, and I

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.520
know that's close to your heart, because that's the one that's

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:51.360
most affecting you.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.959
But there are others that are as bad or almost as bad

00:00:54.959 --> 00:00:57.599
as Antifa, having to do with different people,

00:00:57.599 --> 00:00:59.040
different sections of the world.

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:00.060
But it's terrible.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.099
We're not going to let it go on in this country.

00:01:02.099 --> 00:01:03.500
We're not going to let it go on.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.019
And a big problem is not all of them,

00:01:06.019 --> 00:01:09.300
but some of the networks out there.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.779
And you do wonder why.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:11.779
You really do?

00:01:11.779 --> 00:01:13.820
OK, please.

